  "design": {
    "idea": "Glass Conservatory battle-puzzle: flip Black to shatter the Glass Knight and expose the Black blue-beam sensor, clear Moon Shoals foes, then push Blue Glass into the emitter and rotate the prism to unseal the Ballroom while teasing the dual-locked Throne Vault north.",
    "kind": "combat",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Combining live combat world-flips with movable color_glass tinting and prism beam routing into a Black-only sensor.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 55,
    "reward": "open_r10+r11_tease",
    "why": "Upper Wing convergence hall uniting both East Wing paths and gating the Ballroom and False Throne.",
